</div>
<div class="col-sm-6 order-md-2 order-1">
<div class="mt-6">
<span class="promo-labeled">
surli: Readable.                        </span>
<h3 class="header mb-4 mt-3">
Smaller URL - simpler QR                        </h3>
<p class="existence-sub-text">The size of the QR directly depends on the length of the link you are encrypting. Often you
may need to add the full path along with filters and parameters, referral identifier, UTM tag to
the link. This will make the final URL really huge and the QR difficult to read and recognize.
Wrap a long link of any length in a link like surl.li/clck and get a minimalistic and easy-to-read
QR from any gadget.</p>
<a class="button main-btn main-btn_promo text-white"
href="https://hyperhost.ua/tools/en/qr-code-generator">
QR generator                        </a>
</div>
